Description: AI-powered, read-only code auditor
 Cosmya analyzes a codebase with the help of a large language model and
 reports security vulnerabilities, bugs, architectural weaknesses, and
 other meaningful issues. Cosmya never modifies the audited project; it
 is a strictly read-only, terminal-only inspection tool.
 .
 Supports OpenAI, Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude, and local Ollama models,
 with a Rust-backed, sandboxed filesystem inspection engine.
